<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">MM-HELIX: Boosting Multimodal Long-Chain Reflective Reasoning with Holistic Platform and Adaptive Hybrid Policy Optimization</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
