<span id="A1.SS6.p24.pic1.2.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p24.pic1.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Here is a bunch of bars lined up side by side, where the width of each bar is 1 and consecutive bars are adjacent with no gaps between them. Compute how much water it can trap after raining. Please provide your answer as an integer.</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS6.p24.pic1.2.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p24.pic1.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Reference Answer</span></span>
