<span id="A1.SS6.p25.pic1.2.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p25.pic1.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Here is a bar chart showing how many times each of a researcher’s papers was cited. Determine the researcher’s h-index: the largest value h such that at least h papers have at least h citations each. Please provide your answer as an integer.</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS6.p25.pic1.2.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p25.pic1.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Reference Answer</span></span>
