<span id="A1.SS6.p26.pic1.2.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p26.pic1.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Reference Answer</span></span>
