<span id="A1.SS6.p27.pic1.2.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p27.pic1.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Here is a row of bars each with some height. Pick a subset of these bars where each one is strictly taller than the last and they appear in order from left to right. What’s the longest such sequence you can find? Please provide your answer as an integer.</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS6.p27.pic1.2.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p27.pic1.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Reference Answer</span></span>
