<span id="A1.SS6.p28.pic1.2.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p28.pic1.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Given a row of vertical bars where consecutive bars are adjacent with no gaps between them. Pick any two bars and form the sides of a water container, with the x-axis as the base. How much water can the biggest possible container hold? Please provide your answer as an integer.</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS6.p28.pic1.2.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p28.pic1.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Reference Answer</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS6.p28.pic1.2.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p28.pic1.2.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">18</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
