<span id="A1.SS6.p33.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A1.SS6.p33.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Image</span></span><img src="2510.08540v1/wordladder.png" id="A1.SS6.p33.pic1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:209/148;" width="209" height="148" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
<span id="A1.SS6.p33.pic1.2.1.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A1.SS6.p33.pic1.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Category:</span><span id="A1.SS6.p33.pic1.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Puzzle</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS6.p33.pic1.2.1.3" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A1.SS6.p33.pic1.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Difficulty:</span><span id="A1.SS6.p33.pic1.2.1.3.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Level 1</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.SS6.p33.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:208.2pt;">
<span id="A1.SS6.p33.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p33.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS6.p33.pic1.2.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p33.pic1.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">This is a Word Ladder puzzle. Transform the left word into right word by changing one letter at a time, ensuring that each step forms a valid word. The rules are as follows 1. Change exactly one letter at a time. 2. Each step must form a valid English word. Please provide the complete solution path from ’how’ to ’met’ as a list of strings. Example answer format: ["hug", "bug", "beg", "bet", "set"].</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS6.p33.pic1.2.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p33.pic1.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Reference Answer</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS6.p33.pic1.2.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p33.pic1.2.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">["how", "hot", "got", "get", "met"]</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
