<span id="A1.SS6.p37.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p37.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question</span><span id="A1.SS6.p37.pic1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:4.0pt;"><span id="A1.SS6.p37.pic1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
Given two connected undirected planar graphs G1 and G2 shown below, determine if they are isomorphic by analyzing their planar structure. Answer with ’Yes’ or ’No’.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.SS6.p37.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.SS6.p37.pic1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p37.pic1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Reference Answer</span><span id="A1.SS6.p37.pic1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:4.0pt;"><span id="A1.SS6.p37.pic1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
Yes</span></span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
