<td id="A1.T7.4.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Gemini-2.5-Flash <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib4" title="" class="ltx_ref">Comanici et al., 2025</a>)</cite></td>
